  [329,"4","4.5","wireless/RFID","easy","scenario","Employees report inconsistent wireless connectivity after access points were deployed. Which tool best visualizes weak signal areas?",["Network bandwidth monitor","Protocol analyzer","Heat map software","Intrusion detection system"],2,"Une heat map montre visuellement les zones de couverture Wi-Fi forte et faible."],
  [330,"4","4.1","application security","easy","scenario","A user downloads a software update and wants to verify it is trusted and has not been modified. What should be checked?",["The website SSL certificate","The application's code signing certificate","The open-source repositories","The software's user reviews"],1,"La signature de code valide l'editeur et l'integrite du logiciel signe."],
  [331,"4","4.5","wireless/RFID","easy","scenario","A coffee shop wants a cryptographic protocol that balances security and performance for public Wi-Fi users. Which option is best?",["Advanced Encryption Standard (AES)","Wired Equivalent Privacy (WEP)","RC4 Stream Cipher","Open Wireless"],0,"AES est moderne, robuste et performant, contrairement a WEP, RC4 ou un reseau ouvert."],
  [332,"4","4.1","cloud architecture","medium","scenario","A company uses multi-cloud and wants to harden cloud resources. What is the BEST practice?",["Make all storage buckets public","Apply consistent security configurations and policies across providers","Use the same SSH key pairs everywhere","Limit IAM roles to senior staff only"],1,"Des politiques coherentes entre fournisseurs reduisent les ecarts et les mauvaises configurations."],
  [333,"4","4.3","vulnerability management","easy","scenario","A scan reports a server vulnerability, but manual verification shows it does not exist. What is this?",["False negative","True positive","False positive","Confirmation bias"],2,"Un faux positif signale a tort une vulnerabilite absente."],
  [334,"4","4.1","application security","easy","scenario","Attackers exploited cookies to impersonate sessions. Which measure ensures cookies are transmitted securely between browser and server?",["Store cookies in the database","Implement the Secure attribute for cookies","Increase cookie expiration time","Base64 encode cookie content"],1,"L'attribut Secure force l'envoi du cookie uniquement sur HTTPS."],
  [335,"4","4.3","vulnerability management","easy","scenario","A report references CVE-2023-12345 with a CVSS score of 9.5. What can the analyst conclude?",["The vulnerability was first identified in 2023","The vulnerability is low severity","It affects only software produced in 2023","It is the vendor's internal code"],0,"L'annee dans l'identifiant CVE indique l'annee de publication ou d'identification publique; 9.5 est critique."],
  [336,"4","4.3","threat intelligence","easy","scenario","A company wants specialized intelligence about the latest threats targeting its industry beyond OSINT. What best addresses this?",["Implement internal honeypots","Subscribe to a third-party threat intelligence feed","Attend cybersecurity conferences","Use open-source vulnerability scanners"],1,"Un flux tiers specialise fournit des renseignements sectoriels souvent continus et plus contextualises."],
  [337,"4","4.6","mobile security","easy","scenario","A company adopted BYOD and wants to enforce security policies on personal mobile devices. What is MOST effective?",["Install antivirus on each device","Use a separate guest Wi-Fi","Use MDM to enforce policies","Mandate strong passwords only"],2,"MDM applique centralement les politiques, controles et exigences de conformite sur les terminaux mobiles."],
  [338,"4","4.6","mobile security","easy","scenario","Company mobile devices use cellular data in the background while in the office. What should ensure they use corporate Wi-Fi for data transactions?",["Enable Airplane mode","Set up a Wi-Fi whitelist","Implement an MDM policy to prioritize Wi-Fi","Disable cellular antennas in the office"],2,"Une politique MDM peut prioriser le Wi-Fi et appliquer ce comportement sur les appareils geres."],
  [339,"4","4.3","monitoring","easy","scenario","After an IDS upgrade, no intrusions are flagged even though attempts regularly occur. What is this?",["True negative","False negative","True positive","Confirmation feedback"],1,"Un faux negatif signifie qu'une menace presente n'est pas detectee."],
  [340,"4","4.5","wireless/RFID","easy","scenario","A company is deploying wireless access points in a new office and wants optimal coverage. What should it do before installation?",["Buy the most expensive access points","Conduct a site survey","Deploy all access points near windows","Ensure all users have 5GHz devices"],1,"Un site survey determine les meilleurs emplacements selon obstacles, couverture et interferences."],
  [341,"4","4.6","mobile security","easy","scenario","An employee lost a personal phone managed by MDM. Which feature should IT use to protect company data?",["Monitor the device location","Force update apps","Remote wipe the device","Change the email password"],2,"L'effacement a distance supprime les donnees sensibles de l'appareil perdu."],
  [342,"4","4.3","vulnerability management","easy","scenario","A company wants a comprehensive report of weaknesses without exploiting them. Which activity best meets this objective?",["Penetration test","Vulnerability scan","Red team assessment","Port security"],1,"Un scan de vulnerabilites identifie et rapporte les faiblesses sans chercher a les exploiter."],
  [343,"4","4.1","application security","easy","scenario","Before deployment, a team wants to examine application code without executing it to identify vulnerabilities. Which method should it use?",["Penetration Testing","Dynamic Analysis","Static Analysis","Fuzz Testing"],2,"L'analyse statique inspecte code, bytecode ou binaire sans execution."],
  [344,"4","4.3","vulnerability management","easy","scenario","A weakness would let an attacker modify user accounts and privileges. Which classification best describes it?",["Elevation of privilege vulnerability","Disclosure vulnerability","Replay vulnerability","Remote code execution vulnerability"],0,"Modifier des comptes ou privileges correspond a une elevation de privilege."],
  [345,"4","4.1","hardening","easy","scenario","A healthcare organization uses embedded systems in medical devices. Which is NOT recommended for hardening?",["Regularly patch firmware","Allow unrestricted access for ease of use","Disable unnecessary services","Change default credentials"],1,"L'acces sans restriction augmente le risque de mauvaise configuration, d'abus et de compromission."],
  [346,"4","4.2","asset management","easy","scenario","What is the PRIMARY security reason for maintaining an up-to-date hardware and software inventory?",["Renew licenses on time","Identify and respond to unauthorized devices or software promptly","Aid procurement","Show employees available resources"],1,"Un inventaire a jour aide a reperer rapidement les actifs non autorises ou logiciels a risque."],
  [347,"4","4.1","hardening","easy","scenario","A company is deploying IoT security cameras. What should be prioritized to establish a secure baseline?",["Set devices to public mode","Regularly update device firmware","Enable UPnP","Use the same password for all cameras"],1,"Les mises a jour de firmware corrigent les vulnerabilites connues des appareils IoT."],
  [348,"4","4.1","hardening","easy","scenario","A company wants to improve workstation baselines after malware infections. Which recommendation is BEST?",["Install multiple antivirus solutions","Use cyber hygiene screensavers","Disable unnecessary services and ports","Change desktop wallpaper often"],2,"Desactiver services et ports inutiles reduit la surface d'attaque des postes."],
  [349,"4","4.1","cloud architecture","easy","scenario","Before deploying multiple cloud VMs, what should a company do so each VM starts from a secure configuration?",["Use default provider templates","Establish and use a secure VM baseline","Regularly back up all VMs","Use MFA for cloud access"],1,"Une baseline VM securisee standardise les parametres de securite des nouvelles instances."],
  [350,"4","4.1","hardening","easy","scenario","A company is deploying new servers globally. Which step should be taken FIRST to secure them?",["Set up monitoring","Install all possible future software","Use default configurations","Disable unused services and ports"],3,"Le durcissement initial reduit la surface d'attaque en ne laissant actifs que les services necessaires."],
  [351,"4","4.3","vulnerability management","easy","scenario","A team uses a CVE and CVSS score to assess remediation urgency. Which statement is correct?",["CVE provides severity and CVSS gives an identifier","Both are scoring mechanisms","CVE provides a unique identifier and CVSS provides severity scoring","Both are regulatory requirements"],2,"CVE identifie une vulnerabilite; CVSS mesure sa gravite de facon standardisee."],
  [352,"4","4.6","wireless/RFID","medium","scenario","A university wants campus Wi-Fi credentials verified by a central server and encrypted communication between AP and server. Which solution should it implement?",["WPA3 with SAE","WPA2-Personal with AES","WPA2-Enterprise with RADIUS","Open wireless with VPN"],2,"WPA2-Enterprise avec RADIUS centralise l'authentification et protege l'echange entre AP et serveur."],
  [353,"4","4.3","vulnerability management","easy","scenario","What is the PRIMARY reason to include penetration testing as a threat identification method?",["Ensure compliance only","Validate awareness training","Actively exploit vulnerabilities and assess impact","Identify SIEM misconfigurations"],2,"Le pentest exploite activement des failles pour mesurer leur impact reel et prioriser les corrections."],
  [354,"4","4.1","application security","easy","scenario","Before deploying a critical infrastructure patch, a team wants to safely execute and observe its behavior. What should it use?",["Deploy during a maintenance window","Run it in a sandbox environment","Conduct only a code review","Install it on a virtual machine"],1,"Un sandbox isole et controle l'execution pour observer le comportement sans affecter la production."],
  [355,"4","4.9","data sanitization","easy","scenario","A company sells old servers and needs proof that data destruction due diligence was performed. What should it obtain?",["Receipt of sale","Detailed server usage log","Certificate of data sanitization","Server user manual"],2,"Un certificat de sanitisation atteste que les donnees ont ete effacees selon une methode verifiable."],
  [356,"4","4.9","data governance","easy","scenario","A CISO decommissions old servers but some data must be retained for regulations. Which principle should guide compliance?",["Minimum necessary principle","Least privilege","Data retention policy","Mandatory vacation policy"],2,"La politique de retention definit quelles donnees conserver, combien de temps et comment les traiter."],
  [357,"4","4.1","hardening","medium","scenario","After a server OS update, a company already has a secure baseline. What should it do NEXT to maintain security?",["Reboot all servers","Redeploy the same baseline unchanged","Update the baseline for new configurations and deploy it","Implement a new firewall rule"],2,"Un changement d'OS peut modifier les exigences; la baseline doit etre revue puis redeployee."],
  [358,"4","4.6","mobile security","easy","scenario","Employees receive company-owned devices that may also be used personally, while the company manages and monitors them. Which model is this?",["BYOD","CYOD","COPE","PDD"],2,"COPE signifie appareil appartenant a l'entreprise, autorise pour un usage personnel, mais gere par l'organisation."],
  [359,"4","4.5","wireless/RFID","easy","scenario","A company wants the most recent and secure wireless encryption standard on its access points. What should it configure?",["WEP","WPA","WPA2","WPA3"],3,"WPA3 est la generation la plus recente et ameliore les protections par rapport a WPA2."],
  [360,"4","4.3","threat intelligence","easy","scenario","A security analyst wants real-time threat intelligence from the dark web. Which option is BEST?",["Use an internal vulnerability scanner","Subscribe to a dark web threat intelligence feed","Conduct regular penetration tests","Review daily SIEM reports"],1,"Un flux de threat intelligence dark web fournit des informations externes proactives et mises a jour."],
  [361,"4","4.8","network appliances","easy","scenario","A web application will use HTTPS. Which default port should be configured for encrypted traffic?",["21","80","443","25"],2,"HTTPS utilise par defaut TCP 443."],
  [362,"4","4.7","email security","medium","scenario","A company wants receiving mail servers to validate that email claiming to come from its domain originated from an approved server and was not altered. What should it implement?",["SMTP authentication","DKIM","POP3 over SSL","S/MIME"],1,"DKIM ajoute une signature verifiable avec la cle publique publiee dans DNS pour valider origine de domaine et integrite."],
  [363,"4","4.4","incident response","medium","scenario","A compromised workstation is communicating with a known malicious IP. What is the BEST immediate action to block that communication?",["Implement a block rule on the web filter for the IP address","Disable the workstation network port","Use a honeypot","Update firewall firmware"],0,"Un blocage cible sur l'IP malveillante stoppe directement la communication connue."],
  [364,"4","4.3","vulnerability management","medium","scenario","Which statement BEST describes SCAP?",["Real-time threat intelligence transfer","User authentication against Active Directory","Automated vulnerability management and policy compliance evaluation","Encrypted remote system management"],2,"SCAP automatise l'evaluation de conformite et de vulnerabilites avec des contenus standardises."],
  [365,"4","4.7","web filtering","medium","scenario","A company wants to detect and block malicious URLs that imitate legitimate sites. Which approach is BEST?",["Implement a DNS firewall","Employ URL scanning to identify and block malicious URLs","Rely on manual employee reporting","Use a VPN to redirect web traffic"],1,"Le scan d'URL analyse l'adresse complete et peut bloquer des URL malveillantes ou ressemblantes."],
  [366,"4","4.2","monitoring","medium","scenario","A financial institution wants immediate alerts when unauthorized access to customer data occurs. Which approach is MOST effective?",["Alert on any database record modification","Alert on successful off-hours logins","Establish alerting thresholds based on anomalous user behavior","Send daily reports of all access attempts"],2,"Les seuils comportementaux detectent les ecarts suspects et alertent rapidement avec moins de bruit qu'une simple liste quotidienne."],
  [367,"4","4.6","access control","medium","scenario","A marketing team needs a shared folder but should not modify files created by others. How should permissions be set?",["Full control","Read-only access","Write-only access","Modify permission but deny delete permission"],3,"Autoriser modification tout en refusant suppression limite les actions destructrices sur les fichiers partages."],
  [368,"4","4.3","vulnerability management","easy","scenario","A security analyst wants to proactively discover missing patches, misconfigurations, and system vulnerabilities before go-live. What should she use?",["IDS","Network sniffer","Vulnerability scanner","SIEM"],2,"Un scanner de vulnerabilites detecte correctifs manquants, mauvaises configurations et failles connues."],
  [369,"4","4.2","monitoring","medium","scenario","A company needs centralized real-time status, outages, and metrics across multiple data centers. Which solution is MOST effective?",["DLP tools","DDoS protection","SIEM","Infrastructure Management Platform (IMP)"],3,"Une plateforme de gestion d'infrastructure centralise la sante, les pannes et metriques des sites."],
  [370,"4","4.1","hardening","easy","scenario","A Windows-based organization wants to prevent users from changing system settings such as firewall configuration. What is most effective?",["Use SELinux","Use Group Policy","Deploy third-party locking software","Implement user training only"],1,"Group Policy permet de definir et imposer centralement les parametres Windows."],
  [371,"4","4.8","network appliances","easy","scenario","A company wants encrypted transmission between mail server and client applications. Which protocol is most appropriate?",["HTTP","FTP","IMAP over SSL/TLS","SNMP"],2,"IMAPS chiffre la recuperation des emails entre client et serveur avec SSL/TLS."],
  [372,"4","4.1","hardening","easy","scenario","An administrator uses a benchmark to harden web servers by disabling unnecessary services and setting permissions. Which organization most likely provides it?",["PCI DSS","OWASP","CIS","GDPR"],2,"Les CIS Benchmarks fournissent des recommandations prescriptives de configuration securisee."],
  [373,"4","4.2","monitoring","easy","scenario","An IT department wants alerts whenever critical system files are changed without authorization. What should it use?",["DLP","IDS","File Integrity Monitoring (FIM)","RMM"],2,"FIM surveille les changements de fichiers critiques et alerte sur des modifications non autorisees."],
  [374,"4","4.1","hardening","easy","scenario","A company wants Linux processes restricted to specific resources and actions. Which tool is most appropriate?",["Group Policy applied to Linux","User training","SELinux in enforcing mode","Limit user access only"],2,"SELinux applique un controle d'acces obligatoire aux processus Linux en mode enforcing."],
  [375,"4","4.2","monitoring","easy","scenario","A security administrator wants server monitoring without installing additional software on the servers. Which approach should she choose?",["Agent-based monitoring","IDS","Agentless monitoring","Network-based APM"],2,"Le monitoring agentless collecte les donnees via protocoles ou interfaces standard sans agent installe."],
  [376,"4","4.2","data governance","easy","scenario","A company wants to prevent researchers from transferring proprietary formulas to external storage or cloud while allowing other data transfers. What should it implement?",["WAF","Data encryption tool","DLP","VPN"],2,"DLP detecte et bloque les transferts non autorises de donnees sensibles selon des regles."],
  [377,"4","4.7","email security","easy","scenario","A company already uses DKIM and wants to specify which mail servers are authorized to send on behalf of its domain. What should it adopt?",["SPF","PGP","SSL certificate","IMAP"],0,"SPF publie dans DNS la liste des serveurs autorises a envoyer pour un domaine."],
  [378,"4","4.7","web filtering","easy","scenario","A school wants to block requests to domain names associated with inappropriate content. Which solution best addresses this?",["Firewall filtering by IP","IDS monitoring","VPN enforcement","DNS filtering with a blacklist"],3,"Le filtrage DNS bloque la resolution de domaines listes comme interdits."],
  [379,"4","4.2","monitoring","medium","scenario","An attacker bypassed a signature-based IDS using a zero-day exploit. What would enhance detection capability?",["Switch to a behavior-based IDS","Disable IDS and rely on firewall rules","Update only signatures","Reduce signature update frequency"],0,"Un IDS comportemental peut detecter des anomalies inconnues qui n'ont pas encore de signature."],
  [380,"4","4.3","vulnerability management","easy","scenario","A web application lets attackers upload scripts that execute and grant control over the application. How should this be classified?",["Integrity vulnerability","Availability vulnerability","Remote code execution vulnerability","Disclosure vulnerability"],2,"L'execution de scripts ou commandes par un attaquant correspond a une vulnerabilite RCE."],
  [381,"4","4.2","monitoring","easy","scenario","An IDS flags many legitimate activities, causing a high number of false positives. What should improve accuracy?",["Disable the IDS for a week","Block all external traffic","Implement alert tuning","Ask employees to reduce internet usage"],2,"Le tuning d'alertes ajuste les criteres de detection pour reduire les faux positifs sans desactiver la surveillance."],
  [382,"4","4.6","access control","easy","scenario","A contractor connected an infected laptop to the corporate network. Which solution checks device posture before access?",["IDS","VPN","Network Access Control (NAC)","WAF"],2,"NAC verifie la conformite d'un appareil, comme antivirus et correctifs, avant de permettre l'acces reseau."],
  [383,"4","4.7","email security","easy","scenario","SPF and DKIM are configured. What additional measure defines how receivers should treat emails that fail alignment?",["Enable TLS encryption","Implement DMARC policies","Set up a new SMTP server","Increase email retention"],1,"DMARC indique aux recepteurs s'ils doivent surveiller, mettre en quarantaine ou rejeter les emails non conformes."],
  [384,"4","4.4","incident response","easy","scenario","A company wants to detect, analyze, and respond to advanced endpoint threats in real time. Which solution should it use?",["Vulnerability scanner","IPS","EDR","Patch management system"],2,"EDR surveille les endpoints, analyse les comportements et soutient la reponse aux menaces avancees."],
  [385,"4","4.3","vulnerability management","easy","scenario","After an attack, a team wants to identify unpatched and vulnerable systems on the network. Which scan is BEST?",["Passive scan","Full open port scan","Credentialed vulnerability scan","External DNS resolution scan"],2,"Un scan credentialed inspecte plus profondement les systemes et detecte mieux les correctifs manquants."],
  [386,"4","4.4","incident response","easy","scenario","A legitimate software tool is repeatedly quarantined by security software. What is the BEST action without compromising security?",["Turn off antivirus","Whitelist the software tool","Lower antivirus security","Install a different antivirus"],1,"La liste blanche autorise un outil valide tout en gardant la protection active pour le reste."],
  [387,"4","4.2","monitoring","easy","scenario","A SaaS company needs to centralize logs from multiple cloud providers for streamlined analysis. Which solution is BEST?",["NIDS","Log aggregation tool","DLP software","Vulnerability scanner"],1,"Un outil d'agregation collecte et centralise les journaux de sources diverses."],
  [388,"4","4.1","network appliances","easy","scenario","A manufacturer wants IoT compromises to avoid endangering manufacturing control systems. What is most effective?",["Use one strong firewall for all","Change IoT passwords periodically","Segment IoT devices from control systems","Enable automatic updates only"],2,"La segmentation isole les zones IoT et limite le mouvement lateral vers les systemes de controle."],
  [389,"4","4.7","web filtering","easy","scenario","A global company wants to block hate speech, gambling, and explicit content worldwide. Which web filtering technique is most efficient?",["Centralized proxy with location filtering","Blacklist specific URLs","Content categorization and category blocking","Review logs and reprimand users"],2,"La categorisation bloque des familles entieres de contenus sans maintenir une liste manuelle de chaque URL."],
  [390,"4","4.7","web filtering","easy","scenario","A company wants to monitor, control, restrict web access, and cache frequently accessed web content. Which solution fits best?",["Decentralized proxy per department","DNS-based filtering only","Centralized proxy with caching","Browser extensions for all employees"],2,"Un proxy centralise applique les politiques web et peut cacher le contenu pour reduire la bande passante."],
  [391,"4","4.8","network appliances","easy","scenario","A public web application communicates only over HTTPS. What firewall rule should be configured?",["Allow port 21 and block all others","Allow port 443 and block all others","Allow port 80 and block all others","Allow port 23 and block all others"],1,"HTTPS utilise le port 443; les autres ports listes ne sont pas necessaires pour ce service."],
  [392,"4","4.8","network appliances","easy","scenario","Unauthorized access attempts come from a specific IP range. Which firewall configuration best blocks them temporarily?",["Configure an implicit deny rule for the IP range","Set up a honeypot","Allow but limit bandwidth","Add the range to a whitelist"],0,"Une regle deny pour la plage IP bloque directement les tentatives provenant de cette source."],
  [393,"4","4.7","web filtering","medium","scenario","A company wants web filtering policies enforced on laptops even when employees are offsite. What is BEST?",["Cloud-based web filtering","Force all traffic through VPN","Deploy an agent-based web filter on laptops","Send acceptable use reminders"],2,"Un agent local applique les politiques sur l'appareil quel que soit son emplacement."],
  [394,"4","4.2","monitoring","easy","scenario","A centralized system must correlate logs from multiple sources, detect malicious activity in real time, and produce reports. Which tool fits?",["NIDS","WAF","Vulnerability scanner","SIEM"],3,"Un SIEM agrege, correle et analyse les evenements de securite de sources multiples."],
  [395,"4","4.2","data governance","easy","scenario","An alert says an employee tried to email a document containing social security numbers externally. Which tool most likely generated it?",["NIDS","DLP solution","Vulnerability scanner","Packet analyzer"],1,"DLP surveille les transferts de donnees sensibles et alerte ou bloque les sorties non autorisees."],
  [396,"4","4.6","identity/access","medium","scenario","An online bank wants strong identity proofing when users open new accounts. Which method is MOST secure?",["Security question","Government ID photo plus selfie","Email verification code","Favorite color prompt"],1,"Comparer une piece officielle a un selfie donne une assurance d'identite plus forte qu'un secret faible."],
  [397,"4","4.8","network appliances","medium","scenario","A company wants to limit access to social media sites during peak working hours. Which firewall rule modification fits?",["IPS rule to block social media","Time-based deny rule for known social media IPs from 9 AM to 5 PM","Blacklist social media URLs permanently","Increase firewall bandwidth"],1,"Une regle temporelle bloque l'acces uniquement pendant la plage de travail visee."],
  [398,"4","4.1","secure architecture","medium","scenario","A company wants a public website isolated so compromise does not expose internal data. Which configuration is BEST?",["Put the web server on the internal network","Place it in a DMZ with firewalls before and behind it","Connect it directly to the internet","Place it in a DMZ directly connected to internal network"],1,"Une DMZ avec controle entre Internet, DMZ et LAN limite l'impact d'un serveur public compromis."],
  [399,"4","4.2","monitoring","easy","scenario","Which tool detects unauthorized changes to system files and configurations?",["Network protocol analyzer","File integrity monitoring system","Bandwidth monitoring tool","Passive vulnerability scanner"],1,"FIM detecte les modifications non autorisees des fichiers et configurations critiques."],
  [400,"4","4.7","web filtering","medium","scenario","Malware infections came from newly registered malicious websites. What is the BEST mitigation?",["Block all websites","Use reputation checks and block recently registered domains","Block all non-Business sites","Enforce MFA for internet apps"],1,"Le filtrage par reputation et age de domaine cible les domaines recents souvent utilises pour phishing ou malware."],
  [401,"4","4.3","vulnerability management","medium","scenario","Cloud risk analysis considers data center location, local laws, and natural disaster frequency. What are these considerations?",["Asset valuation factors","Risk response variables","Threat intelligence variables","Environmental variables"],3,"Les variables environnementales sont des facteurs externes qui influencent l'exposition et le risque."],
  [402,"4","4.4","incident response","easy","scenario","A suspicious unfamiliar file is detected on a mission-critical server. What is the BEST immediate action?",["Delete it immediately","Quarantine the file","Make a copy only","Notify all employees"],1,"La quarantaine isole le fichier pour empecher execution ou propagation tout en permettant l'analyse."],
  [403,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","A new remote sales employee needs an account provisioned. What is the BEST approach?",["Give CEO-level access","Give administrative rights","Use a salesperson access template","Let the user self-select access"],2,"Un modele base sur le role sales fournit les acces necessaires selon le moindre privilege."],
  [404,"4","4.4","change management","easy","scenario","A company developed a patch for a critical vulnerability. What should it do before distributing it to customers?",["Deploy it everywhere immediately","Notify the media","Test the patch in a controlled environment","Offer compensation"],2,"Tester le correctif en environnement controle verifie son efficacite et evite les regressions."],
  [405,"4","4.3","vulnerability management","easy","scenario","After implementing patches, what should be the primary next step to validate effectiveness?",["Deploy more firewalls","Train all employees","Rescan systems","Change all passwords"],2,"Un nouveau scan confirme que les vulnerabilites traitees ne sont plus detectees."],
  [406,"4","4.2","monitoring","medium","scenario","A payment web application team wants immediate notification of application errors or unauthorized codebase modifications. Which tool should they implement?",["WAF","APM","DNS monitoring tool","Network flow analyzer"],1,"APM surveille la sante applicative, erreurs et anomalies de fonctionnement ou de changement."],
  [407,"4","4.2","monitoring","easy","scenario","A switch sends an immediate notification when a power supply fails. Which mechanism was most likely used?",["Syslog server","SNMP traps","Packet sniffer","Firewall logs"],1,"Les traps SNMP sont des alertes non sollicitees envoyees par un equipement vers une station de gestion."],
  [408,"4","4.5","data governance","medium","scenario","A company can tolerate up to $500,000 loss, then buys cyber insurance for losses beyond that. What is the $500,000 figure?",["Risk appetite","Risk threshold","Risk capacity","Risk assessment"],1,"Le seuil de risque est le niveau specifique qu'une organisation accepte avant d'agir autrement."],
  [409,"4","4.2","monitoring","easy","scenario","A monthly senior management security posture report must communicate current status effectively. What is MOST important to include?",["Detailed technical logs","Graphical incident representation by category","Complete user access list","Copies of phishing emails"],1,"Des graphiques par categorie rendent les tendances et priorites comprehensibles pour la direction."],
  [410,"4","4.5","monitoring","easy","scenario","A network analyst wants metadata about IP traffic flows including IPs, ports, and protocols. Which tool should be used?",["IDS","Syslog server","NetFlow collector","SNMP traps"],2,"NetFlow collecte des metadonnees de flux reseau utiles pour analyser volumes et comportements."],
  [411,"4","4.4","indicators","easy","scenario","Logs show encrypted outbound traffic from a sensitive server to an unfamiliar IP during non-business hours. What is MOST likely?",["Patch download","Remote employee access","Server backup","Data exfiltration"],3,"Un flux sortant chiffre vers une IP inconnue depuis un serveur sensible est un indicateur fort d'exfiltration."],
  [412,"4","4.6","access control","easy","scenario","A company assigns permissions to departmental roles such as Marketing instead of individual users. Which model is used?",["Rule-based access control","MAC","DAC","RBAC"],3,"RBAC attribue les permissions a des roles puis les utilisateurs heritent de ces roles."],
  [413,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","Technicians authenticate by looking into a device that maps a unique pattern. What is being used?",["Password system","Retina scanning","Hardware token","Knowledge-based questions"],1,"Le scan de retine est une biometrie, donc un facteur quelque chose que l'utilisateur est."],
  [414,"4","4.4","incident response","medium","scenario","Off-hour attacks cause more damage due to delayed response. What BEST decreases reaction time?",["Train staff for business-hour volume","Implement automated intrusion detection and response","Increase off-hour staff only","Send email notifications"],1,"L'automatisation detecte et repond plus vite, meme hors heures de bureau."],
  [415,"4","4.4","forensics","easy","scenario","Before presenting forensic findings to the board, what should the investigator ensure?",["Use technical jargon","Emphasize credentials","Provide a clear concise summary without unnecessary technical details","Include every detailed action log"],2,"Un rapport pour la direction doit etre clair, concis et centre sur les constats et impacts."],
  [416,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","A company wants LDAP users to access multiple cloud services without re-entering credentials. What should it do?",["Abandon LDAP and create separate accounts","Integrate LDAP with cloud SSO","Store plaintext passwords","Force daily password changes"],1,"SSO integre a l'annuaire existant permet une authentification unique vers plusieurs services."],
  [417,"4","4.6","access control","easy","scenario","Access to cloud files depends on department, job title, and years of service. Which model is used?",["Rule-Based Access Control","RBAC","ABAC","DAC"],2,"ABAC prend des decisions avec plusieurs attributs utilisateur, ressource et contexte."],
  [418,"4","4.8","network appliances","easy","scenario","Firewall logs are reviewed because users cannot access external websites. What log entry indicates an outbound rule is blocking traffic?",["External IP repeatedly ALLOWED","Large timestamp gaps","DROP/REJECT outbound to ports 80 and 443","Inbound traffic from unknown IPs"],2,"DROP ou REJECT sur ports 80/443 sortants indique le blocage du trafic web."],
  [419,"4","4.6","identity/access","medium","scenario","Frequent 30-day password changes cause weak passwords and notes. How can security be maintained while addressing this?",["Reduce change frequency but add complexity requirements","Eliminate passwords and rely only on 2FA","Change passwords weekly","Allow reuse of last three passwords"],0,"Moins de rotation combinee a de meilleures exigences reduit la fatigue tout en gardant des mots de passe robustes."],
  [420,"4","4.2","monitoring","medium","scenario","IDS alerts on payloads exploiting a known vulnerability, but the internal system is patched. What type of alert is this?",["False positive","False negative","True positive","True negative"],2,"Le trafic est bien malveillant; l'IDS le signale correctement meme si la cible n'est pas vulnerable."],
  [421,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","A platform wants third-party apps to access user data with limited scoped access without sharing passwords. What should it use?",["Embed user passwords","Basic authentication for every request","OAuth token-based access","CAPTCHA only"],2,"OAuth fournit des jetons scopes et evite de partager les mots de passe utilisateur."],
  [422,"4","4.4","automation","easy","scenario","IT manually deploys patches to thousands of workstations. What solution BEST improves efficiency?",["Disable automatic updates","Automated patch management system","Dedicated manual patch team","Educate users to patch themselves"],1,"La gestion automatisee des correctifs reduit l'effort manuel et standardise les deploiements."],
  [423,"4","4.6","identity/access","medium","scenario","A company wants SSO to vendor web apps by securely exchanging authentication information with service providers. What should it implement?",["Independent LDAP per app","SAML SSO","Encrypted credentials in URLs","Public API keys"],1,"SAML permet l'echange securise d'assertions d'authentification entre fournisseur d'identite et services."],
  [424,"4","4.6","identity/access","medium","scenario","A company wants remote servers to prove their software integrity before being allowed onto the primary network. Which solution fits?",["Host-based firewall","Application whitelisting","Remote attestation","VPN tunneling"],2,"L'attestation distante prouve l'etat logiciel d'un systeme avant de lui faire confiance."],
  [425,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","Two business partners want employees to use existing credentials across organizations without new accounts. What enables this?",["Create new partner accounts","Allow anonymous access","Implement identity federation","Reset and share passwords"],2,"La federation etablit une relation de confiance entre fournisseurs d'identite et de service."],
  [426,"4","4.4","indicators","easy","scenario","Endpoint logs are reviewed after malware infection. Which entry best indicates the initial infection point?",["Successful login/logout events","System health OK entries","Unknown .exe installed and run from a temp directory","Domain controller connectivity checks"],2,"Un executable inconnu lance depuis un repertoire temporaire est un indicateur typique d'infection."],
  [427,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","Access from an unfamiliar location triggers extra verification. Which authentication factor is emphasized?",["Knowledge-based questions","Fingerprint scan","Physical coordinates of the access point","SMS code"],2,"La localisation correspond au facteur somewhere you are."],
  [428,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","MFA requires memorized information that cannot be physically taken. Which factor example is this?",["Fingerprint","Smart card","PIN","USB security key"],2,"Un PIN est un facteur de connaissance: quelque chose que l'utilisateur sait."],
  [429,"4","4.8","access control","easy","scenario","A firewall allows ports 80 and 443 while denying all other traffic by default. Which access control type is this?",["RBAC","MAC","DAC","Rule-Based Access Control"],3,"Des regles administratives de pare-feu appliquent un controle d'acces base sur des regles."],
  [430,"4","4.2","monitoring","easy","scenario","A SIEM dashboard should quickly identify an employee uploading large proprietary data to external cloud storage. Which view is MOST effective?",["Off-hours logins","Highest network bandwidth users","Most frequently used applications","Failed login attempts"],1,"Une exfiltration volumineuse se manifeste souvent par une hausse de bande passante sortante."],
  [431,"4","4.6","access control","easy","scenario","A document owner wants to grant edit access to some team members and view-only access to others. Which model best allows this?",["MAC","RBAC","DAC","ABAC"],2,"DAC permet au proprietaire d'une ressource de definir les permissions d'autres utilisateurs."],
  [432,"4","4.2","monitoring","easy","scenario","A CISO wants to investigate possible unauthorized data transfers outside business hours. Which automated report is MOST useful?",["After-hours network activity reports","Password change frequency reports","Hardware inventory reports","Software licensing reports"],0,"Les rapports d'activite reseau hors horaires ciblent directement les transferts suspects recherches."],
  [433,"4","4.4","forensics","easy","scenario","A forensic analyst captures system memory from a compromised host. Why is this volatile data useful?",["It helps identify deleted files","It can capture data in real-time operations","It provides patch levels","It shows firewall configurations"],1,"La memoire peut contenir processus actifs, connexions et artefacts presents au moment de l'incident."],
  [434,"4","4.4","forensics","medium","scenario","An administrator disconnected a compromised server and was criticized by a forensic expert. Why?",["He should have left it connected to watch the attacker","He should have first informed legal","He should have imaged memory before disconnecting","He should have updated software immediately"],2,"La memoire volatile peut contenir des preuves et doit idealement etre capturee avant coupure ou deconnexion risquee."],
  [435,"4","4.4","automation","medium","scenario","Automation lets teams provision environments, but security worries about misconfigurations and excessive permissions. What should be used?",["Zero trust model only","Manual review of all requests","Guard rails in automation scripts","Disable automation except for security"],2,"Les guard rails imposent des limites de securite dans l'automatisation sans bloquer l'agilite."],
  [436,"4","4.4","forensics","easy","scenario","A forensic investigator labels a hard drive, records serial number, photographs the scene, and transports it securely. These steps maintain what?",["Data integrity only","Chain of custody","Data decryption","Legal hold"],1,"La chaine de conservation documente qui a manipule la preuve et comment elle a ete protegee."],
  [437,"4","4.2","monitoring","easy","scenario","Users report feature access issues after deployment. Which application log entry most directly indicates a software bug?",["Successful authentication timestamps","Transaction counts","ERROR or EXCEPTION for the feature","Routine backup entries"],2,"Des entrees ERROR ou EXCEPTION liees a la fonctionnalite pointent vers un probleme applicatif."],
  [438,"4","4.4","incident response","easy","scenario","After a breach, management wants the primary reason identified to prevent recurrence. What should the IR team prioritize?",["Scan all servers","Review firewall logs only","Conduct root cause analysis","Upgrade all security software"],2,"La RCA identifie la cause fondamentale afin de corriger durablement le probleme."],
  [439,"4","4.4","automation","easy","scenario","Cloud resources generate performance alerts and relevant teams must act quickly when thresholds are crossed. What is BEST?",["Weekly alert meetings","Automate ticket creation and assignment","Send all alerts to one email box","Disable performance monitoring"],1,"La creation automatique de tickets dirige rapidement l'alerte vers l'equipe responsable."],
  [440,"4","4.1","automation","medium","scenario","A financial development team wants code changes tested for vulnerabilities and regressions automatically. What is BEST?",["Monthly manual review","Continuous integration with vulnerability and functional tests","Rely on user reports","Use a firewall only"],1,"CI automatise compilation et tests pour detecter tot les failles et regressions."],
  [441,"4","4.4","forensics","medium","scenario","Legal issues an e-discovery notice for a former executive's email. What should IT do FIRST?",["Back up the whole email server","Identify and isolate relevant email accounts","Delete emails older than two years","Inform the media"],1,"Il faut localiser et preserver les donnees pertinentes pour eviter alteration ou suppression."],
  [442,"4","4.4","automation","easy","scenario","A healthcare provider automates user provisioning across multiple systems for new workers. Why?",["Uniform passwords for all","Consistent simultaneous account creation across platforms","Block access until probation ends","Delay activation to reduce licenses"],1,"L'automatisation cree les comptes de facon coherente, rapide et moins sujette aux erreurs."],
  [443,"4","4.2","threat intelligence","easy","scenario","An analyst manually investigates unusual traffic instead of waiting for automated alerts. What is this?",["Incident management","Threat modeling","Threat hunting","Security monitoring"],2,"La chasse aux menaces est une recherche proactive et humaine d'activites suspectes."],
  [444,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","Employees reuse the same passwords across systems. Which best practice mitigates this?",["Monthly password changes","Account lockout after three failures","Prohibit reuse of at least the last five passwords","Alphabetical-only passwords"],2,"L'historique de mots de passe empeche de recycler les memes secrets."],
  [445,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","Which password strategy is MOST secure among the options?",["At least 6 characters only","At least 10 with upper/lowercase","At least 8 with upper, lower, numbers, and special characters","At least 4 with mixed case"],2,"La combinaison longueur et complexite rend le mot de passe plus resistant aux attaques."],
  [446,"4","4.2","monitoring","easy","scenario","Which IPS log entry BEST indicates port scanning?",["Many consecutive attempts to different ports on one server quickly","Repeated attempts to port 80 every 3 seconds","Many failed FTP logins","Regular pings to gateway"],0,"Un scan de ports teste rapidement plusieurs ports pour decouvrir les services ouverts."],
  [447,"4","4.4","automation","easy","scenario","What is the PRIMARY benefit of automation scripts for provisioning cloud resources like databases, web servers, and load balancers?",["Use one OS everywhere","Guarantee 100% uptime","Standardized, repeatable, rapid deployments","Prevent all unauthorized access"],2,"L'automatisation rend les deploiements coherents, reproductibles et rapides."],
  [448,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","What is the PRIMARY advantage of passwordless authentication?",["Users choose any password complexity","It eliminates remembering passwords","It guarantees protection from all threats","It works with all legacy systems"],1,"Le passwordless reduit les risques lies aux mots de passe faibles, reutilises ou oublies."],
  [449,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","Remote access requires a password plus a physical device. Which represents the something you have factor?",["Password hint","Facial recognition","Hardware token","Voice recognition"],2,"Un jeton materiel est un objet possede par l'utilisateur."],
  [450,"4","4.2","indicators","easy","scenario","Which Windows security log entry most likely indicates unauthorized access attempts?",["Windows Update success","Many failed logins followed by a successful login outside business hours","Disk defragmentation tasks","Printer connection logs"],1,"Des echecs nombreux suivis d'une reussite hors horaires suggerent force brute ou acces non autorise."],
  [451,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","A bank wants authentication using unique physical or behavioral characteristics. Which method should it consider?",["Token-based authentication","Geolocation tracking","Biometrics","Smart card"],2,"La biometrie utilise empreinte, visage, voix ou autres traits uniques."],
  [452,"4","4.4","incident response","easy","scenario","A team wants to assess data breach response readiness without performing real actions. Which method is BEST?",["Live fire exercise","System hardening test","Red team/blue team exercise","Tabletop exercise"],3,"Un tabletop est un exercice de discussion qui teste roles et decisions sans action en production."],
  [453,"4","4.4","forensics","easy","scenario","A cybersecurity analyst must ensure digital evidence remains intact for a potential lawsuit. What should be implemented?",["Encrypt the evidence","Initiate a legal hold","Perform a full disk wipe","Conduct a vulnerability assessment"],1,"Un legal hold preserve les donnees pertinentes et interdit leur suppression ou alteration."],
  [454,"4","4.6","access control","easy","scenario","A system must grant access based on data classifications and user clearance levels. Which model fits BEST?",["RBAC","DAC","MAC","ABAC"],2,"MAC applique des decisions basees sur etiquettes de classification et niveaux d'habilitation."],
  [455,"4","4.3","vulnerability management","easy","scenario","After an exploit, which vulnerability scan information best pinpoints the potentially compromised server?",["Scan timestamp","Scanner software version","Hosts with the specific vulnerability related to the exploit","Total number of vulnerabilities"],2,"La liste des hotes affectes par la faille exploitee permet d'identifier les cibles probables."],
  [456,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","A junior admin receives only monitoring permissions and cannot modify firewall rules. Which principle is this?",["MAC","RBAC","Time-of-Day restrictions","Least Privilege"],3,"Le moindre privilege donne seulement les droits necessaires aux taches du poste."],
  [457,"4","4.4","email security","easy","scenario","To verify whether a phishing email truly came from an executive, which metadata is MOST useful?",["Subject line","Send time and date","Originating IP address in email headers","Email size"],2,"Les en-tetes email peuvent reveler l'adresse IP d'origine et aider a valider ou contester la legitimite."],
  [458,"4","4.4","automation","easy","scenario","An inventory system must update website and third-party stock levels automatically when a sale occurs. What should be leveraged?",["Backups and restores","Customer reports","APIs","Daily manual audits"],2,"Les API permettent la synchronisation temps reel entre systemes."],
  [459,"4","4.6","identity/access","easy","scenario","What is a primary benefit of password managers for employees using weak passwords?",["They update operating systems","They generate and store complex passwords","They always prevent phishing","They encourage password reuse"],1,"Un gestionnaire peut creer et stocker des mots de passe forts et uniques."],
  [460,"4","4.4","network appliances","medium","scenario","A retail website suffers DDoS attacks and relies on manual traffic verification before mitigation. What BEST improves reaction time?",["Ask users to report slow loading","Manually back up hourly","Deploy a WAF with automated DDoS mitigation","Increase bandwidth only"],2,"Une protection DDoS automatisee detecte et filtre plus vite le trafic d'attaque qu'un processus manuel."],
  [461,"5","5.4","encryption/data protection","medium","scenario","A financial firm stores sensitive client data and wants it unreadable if intercepted during transmission or if storage is compromised. Which standard best serves this requirement?",["Symmetric encryption using a shared key","Hashing the data with a one-way function","Encrypting the entire database using transparent data encryption","Storing the data in a proprietary format"],2,"TDE chiffre la base de donnees et protege les donnees au repos; les cles restent necessaires pour lire les donnees."],
  [462,"5","5.3","contracts","easy","scenario","Two companies want standard terms for ongoing transactions, including payment terms, delivery protocols, and warranties. Which agreement is most suitable?",["Memorandum of understanding (MOU)","Non-disclosure agreement (NDA)","Licensing agreement","Master service agreement (MSA)"],3,"Un MSA etablit un cadre general de conditions pour des transactions futures entre parties."],
  [463,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A team categorizes project risks as Low, Medium, High, and Critical. Which type of risk analysis is this?",["Quantitative","Statistical","Qualitative","Financial"],2,"L'analyse qualitative utilise des categories descriptives au lieu de valeurs numeriques."],
  [464,"5","5.3","supply chain","easy","scenario","A bank selects a vendor for an online transaction system and wants assurance about security practices and history. Which step is most relevant?",["Check sales growth","Conduct due diligence on security practices","Compare visual UI appeal","Evaluate marketing strategies"],1,"La due diligence securite examine la posture, les controles et les antecedents du fournisseur."],
  [465,"5","5.4","business continuity","easy","scenario","An organization wants critical applications restored within 4 hours and data loss not to exceed 1 hour after a disaster. Which policy is most relevant?",["Data Retention Policy","Incident Response Policy","Disaster Recovery Policy","Password Policy"],2,"La politique de reprise apres sinistre definit RTO, RPO et procedures de restauration."],
  [466,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A company estimates that a breach of one server would cause $500,000 in direct losses. What does this estimation represent?",["Annual Rate of Occurrence (ARO)","Total Cost of Ownership (TCO)","Single Loss Expectancy (SLE)","Annualized Loss Expectancy (ALE)"],2,"SLE est la perte financiere attendue pour un seul evenement."],
  [467,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A company had two server breaches over five years. What is the Annualized Rate of Occurrence?",["0.2","0.4","2","5"],1,"ARO = nombre d'evenements / nombre d'annees = 2 / 5 = 0,4."],
  [468,"5","5.1","incident response","easy","scenario","A CISO wants a plan including identification, containment, eradication, recovery, and lessons learned. Which policy primarily covers this?",["Change Management Policy","Incident Response Policy","Disaster Recovery Policy","Remote Access Policy"],1,"Une politique de reponse aux incidents decrit les phases de gestion d'un incident securite."],
  [469,"5","5.3","supply chain","medium","scenario","A shortlisted cybersecurity consultant recently hired the selecting company's former CISO. What should be the immediate concern?",["Expertise brought by the former CISO","Possible discounted price","Potential conflict of interest","Global reputation"],2,"Une relation anterieure peut biaiser la selection et creer un conflit d'interets."],
  [470,"5","5.4","business continuity","easy","scenario","A server model tends to fail once every 2000 hours on average. Which metric is being evaluated?",["RTO","MTTR","MTBF","RPO"],2,"MTBF mesure le temps moyen entre deux pannes."],
  [471,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A company pursues aggressive growth in untested markets and accepts significant risks for higher rewards. How is its risk appetite classified?",["Conservative","Expansionary","Neutral","Risk-averse"],1,"Une appetence expansionary accepte plus de risque pour viser plus de rendement."],
  [472,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A risk assessment was conducted only for a merger and is not planned to repeat. What type is it?",["Recurring","Continuous","One-time","Dynamic"],2,"Une evaluation one-time est realisee pour un evenement specifique et ponctuel."],
  [473,"5","5.1","application security","easy","scenario","A breach came from a custom application vulnerability introduced during coding and missed in testing. Which policy should be emphasized?",["Incident Response Policy","Change Management Policy","Business Continuity Policy","SDLC Policy"],3,"Une politique SDLC integre la securite dans tout le cycle de developpement logiciel."],
  [474,"5","5.2","risk management","medium","scenario","A cloud API is public and has had several vulnerabilities reported in the past six months. What does this most directly increase?",["Assurance from testing","Low industry breach likelihood","Likelihood rating","Provider SLA protection"],2,"Une API publique avec historique recent de failles augmente fortement la probabilite d'exploitation."],
  [475,"5","5.1","identity/access","easy","scenario","A company wants accounts temporarily inaccessible after a certain number of failed login attempts. Which standard fits?",["Password minimum length","Account lockout threshold","Mandatory password resets","Two-factor authentication"],1,"Le seuil de verrouillage definit combien d'echecs entrainent un blocage temporaire."],
  [476,"5","5.4","business continuity","easy","scenario","It took an average of 4 hours from identifying a breach to fully resolving it. Which metric describes this?",["RTO","RPO","MTBF","MTTR"],3,"MTTR mesure le temps moyen necessaire pour reparer ou resoudre un incident."],
  [477,"5","5.5","compliance","easy","scenario","A telecom company expands into a country with strict rules for external communications. What should be its primary focus?",["Increase advertising","Meet national secure communications standards","Collaborate locally for culture","Launch tailored products"],1,"La conformite aux normes nationales de communication securisee est prioritaire pour eviter sanctions et risques."],
  [478,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A company is willing to accept risks that may reduce annual profits by up to 10%, but no more. Which term describes this?",["Risk Avoidance","Risk Transfer","Risk Tolerance","Risk Assessment"],2,"La tolerance au risque indique le niveau maximal de risque accepte."],
  [479,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A company conducts a risk assessment every six months. What type is this?",["Periodic","Ad hoc","Continuous","Recurring"],3,"Une evaluation recurring revient a intervalles definis."],
  [480,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A team performs a spontaneous assessment after learning of a new third-party library vulnerability. What is this?",["Routine","Ad hoc","Scheduled","Benchmark"],1,"Une evaluation ad hoc est declenchee par une situation specifique non planifiee."],
  [481,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A vulnerability would cause $10,000 repair costs, $5,000 customer compensation, and a $15,000 fine. What is the SLE?",["$10,000","$20,000","$30,000","$50,000"],2,"SLE additionne les pertes d'un evenement: 10 000 + 5 000 + 15 000 = 30 000."],
  [482,"5","5.3","contracts","easy","scenario","A cloud contract should require data retrieval under 2 seconds 99.9% of the time. Which component should define this?",["Pricing model","Data sovereignty clauses","Service-level agreement (SLA)","Termination clauses"],2,"Un SLA definit les niveaux de service attendus, metriques et consequences."],
  [483,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A team estimates a 0.25 probability that a vulnerability will be exploited next year. What does this mean?",["A 1 in 4 chance next year","Certain exploitation four times","Exploited 25 times last year","Every fourth customer will exploit it"],0,"0,25 correspond a 25 %, soit une chance sur quatre."],
  [484,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A risk register tracks a 20% increase in abandoned shopping carts as an early warning metric. How should it be categorized?",["Risk Appetite","Risk Mitigation Strategy","Key Risk Indicator (KRI)","Risk Tolerance Threshold"],2,"Un KRI est une metrique qui signale une hausse potentielle du risque."],
  [485,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A company averages 3 phishing attacks every year. What is the ARO?",["0.33","1","3","12"],2,"ARO represente la frequence annuelle attendue, ici 3 par an."],
  [486,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A company wants risks to stay below its maximum acceptable financial loss level. What should be defined in the risk register?",["Risk Owner Assignment","KRI","Risk Impact Analysis","Risk Threshold"],3,"Le seuil de risque fixe le maximum tolerable avant priorisation ou traitement."],
  [487,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A solution constantly evaluates the threat landscape and alerts on live changes so security posture can adapt quickly. What assessment model is used?",["One-time","Periodic","Dynamic","Continuous"],3,"Une evaluation continue surveille les risques en permanence et en temps reel."],
  [488,"5","5.3","penetration testing","easy","scenario","Before partnering with a software provider, an organization wants the most direct method to assess application robustness against cyber threats. What should it do?",["Conduct internal awareness training","Review past audit reports","Implement firewall rules","Perform a penetration test on the application"],3,"Un test d'intrusion simule des attaques pour evaluer directement les failles exploitables."],
  [489,"5","5.5","compliance","easy","scenario","A health tech company launches in the U.S. using patient data. Which external industry consideration is primary?",["Fitness app integrations","HIPAA compliance","Doctor interface surveys","Pharma promotional deals"],1,"HIPAA encadre la protection des informations de sante aux Etats-Unis."],
  [490,"5","5.1","policies","easy","scenario","New employees must understand responsibilities for company devices and internet resources. Which policy belongs in onboarding?",["Password Complexity Policy","Data Classification Policy","Acceptable Use Policy (AUP)","Vendor Management Policy"],2,"Une AUP definit les usages acceptables des ressources informatiques de l'entreprise."],
  [491,"5","5.2","data governance","easy","scenario","Who is primarily responsible for data in a specific IT system and acts as the main decision contact?",["System administrator","Data custodian","System owner","End-user"],2,"Le system owner ou data owner porte la responsabilite des decisions et protections du systeme ou des donnees."],
  [492,"5","5.3","contracts","easy","scenario","A company wants the future right to inspect a vendor's operations and security controls. Which contract clause is needed?",["NDA","SLA","Termination clause","Right-to-audit clause"],3,"La clause right-to-audit autorise l'audit des pratiques, controles et enregistrements du fournisseur."],
  [493,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A stable company wants to maintain market share, accepts minor risks, and avoids major disruptions. What is its risk appetite?",["Expansionary","Neutral","Conservative","Aggressive"],1,"Une appetence neutre accepte certains risques mineurs sans chercher de pari agressif."],
  [494,"5","5.3","contracts","easy","scenario","Two research departments want to express mutual intentions without legally binding obligations. Which document fits?",["SLA","NDA","MOU","Licensing agreement"],2,"Un MOU formalise des intentions communes sans toujours creer d'obligations contractuelles fortes."],
  [495,"5","5.3","contracts","easy","scenario","A cybersecurity project needs tasks, deliverables, timelines, and resources documented. Which agreement captures these details?",["MOU","Joint venture agreement","MSA","Work order or statement of work"],3,"Un SOW ou WO detaille les travaux, livrables, calendrier et ressources d'un projet precis."],
  [496,"5","5.4","business continuity","easy","scenario","A BIA says online banking can tolerate a maximum of 4 hours downtime before major losses. Which concept describes this target?",["RPO","MTD","RTO","TTR"],2,"RTO est le delai cible pour restaurer un service apres interruption."],
  [497,"5","5.5","privacy","easy","scenario","A company determines how and why personal data is processed, while another company stores it. What role does the first company play?",["Processor","Data subject","Controller","Third-party provider"],2,"Le controller decide les finalites et moyens du traitement des donnees personnelles."],
  [498,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A team brainstorms, interviews, and reviews historical data to list threats for a new venture. Which risk management step is this?",["Risk assessment","Risk response","Risk monitoring","Risk identification"],3,"L'identification des risques consiste a reperer et decrire les risques possibles."],
  [499,"5","5.2","risk management","medium","scenario","A vulnerability could expose 30% of stored patient data. Which term best describes the 30% value?",["Threat likelihood","Rate of occurrence","Exposure factor","Patients already impacted"],2,"L'exposure factor mesure la proportion ou valeur d'actif affectee si le risque se materialise."],
  [500,"5","5.4","business continuity","easy","scenario","A power outage showed there was no guidance to maintain or restore operations. Which policy should be prioritized?",["Data Classification Policy","Business Continuity Policy","Acceptable Use Policy","Network Segmentation Strategy"],1,"Une politique de continuite d'activite indique comment maintenir ou restaurer les fonctions essentielles."],
  [501,"5","5.1","policies","easy","scenario","Remote work guidelines should help employees follow security best practices at home. What should be the primary focus?",["Punitive measures","Legal position","Security measures for home networks and devices","Exact hardware specifications"],2,"Des guidelines donnent des recommandations pratiques, ici pour reseaux domestiques et appareils."],
  [502,"5","5.1","policies","easy","scenario","A company lacks a comprehensive document describing its stance and commitment to protecting information assets. What should be created?",["Incident Response Plan","Information Security Policy","Acceptable Use Policy","Data Backup Strategy"],1,"La politique de securite de l'information est le document cadre de l'engagement et des responsabilites securite."],
  [503,"5","5.3","contracts","easy","scenario","Two companies share responsibilities for a collaboration but have not established legally binding obligations. Which agreement fits?",["SLA","NDA","MOA","Licensing agreement"],2,"Un MOA formalise une entente et des responsabilites communes, souvent avant un contrat plus contraignant."],
  [504,"5","5.1","identity/access","easy","scenario","Users make minimal password changes during resets. Which standard forces more uniqueness over time?",["Password history retention","Password expiration period","Account lockout duration","Maximum password age"],0,"L'historique empeche la reutilisation de mots de passe precedents."],
  [505,"5","5.3","contracts","easy","scenario","A client will share sensitive patient data with a consulting company. Which agreement should be in place before sharing?",["MOU","SLA","NDA","SOW"],2,"Un NDA protege les informations confidentielles contre divulgation ou mauvais usage."],
  [506,"5","5.2","risk management","easy","scenario","A vulnerability has ARO 2 and SLE $50,000. What is the expected annual loss?",["$10,000","$100,000","$25,000","$1,000,000"],1,"ALE = ARO x SLE = 2 x 50 000 = 100 000."],
  [507,"5","5.5","privacy","medium","scenario","A healthcare provider handles many EU citizens' patient records. What GDPR requirement should be considered before sharing access?",["Use data only for tax reporting","Acquire explicit consent before sharing data","Use proprietary encryption","Store all data physically in the EU"],1,"Le consentement explicite est un principe central pour certains traitements et partages de donnees personnelles sensibles."],
  [508,"5","5.4","business continuity","easy","scenario","A service restored from backups 6 hours before an outage, losing the last 6 hours of interactions. What term describes this gap?",["RTO","MTD","RDP","RPO"],3,"RPO mesure la perte de donnees maximale acceptable exprimee en temps."],
  [509,"5","5.3","supply chain","easy","scenario","A client wants proof that a vendor periodically examines and strengthens internal procedures and controls. What should be requested?",["Business continuity plan","Client list","Evidence of internal audits","Mission statement"],2,"Des preuves d'audits internes montrent que le fournisseur examine ses controles et procedures."],
  [510,"5","5.5","compliance","easy","scenario","A fintech launches a mobile banking app worldwide. Which legal external consideration is MOST important?",["Global data privacy compliance","Brand color rules","Image copyrights","Cultural sensitivity of the name"],0,"Une application bancaire traite des donnees sensibles; les lois de confidentialite mondiales sont prioritaires."],
  [511,"5","5.5","compliance","easy","scenario","A medical device maker fails security and patient data standards. Which repercussion is MOST critical for operations?",["More PR campaigns","Short-term stock changes","Device discounts","Loss of license to manufacture and distribute"],3,"La perte de licence peut empecher directement l'entreprise d'operer."],
  [512,"5","5.5","compliance","easy","scenario","An organization repeatedly violates guidelines of a global standards organization it pledged to follow. What is the likely immediate consequence?",["Immediate business license revocation","Sanctions from the standards organization","Forced shutdown of all online operations","Mandatory public apology"],1,"Un organisme de standards peut imposer des sanctions pour non-respect repete de ses exigences."],
  [513,"5","5.5","compliance","easy","scenario","A hospital wants confirmation its EHR system complies with national patient data regulations. Which audit is most appropriate?",["Internal self-assessment","Third-party risk assessment","External regulatory audit","Informal peer review"],2,"Un audit reglementaire externe valide formellement la conformite aux exigences nationales."],
  [514,"5","5.5","penetration testing","easy","scenario","A test team tries to bypass barriers, unlock doors, and access restricted floors as maintenance staff. What type of testing is this?",["Network vulnerability scanning","Physical penetration testing","OS fingerprinting","Source code review"],1,"Le test d'intrusion physique evalue les controles d'acces aux locaux et zones restreintes."],
  [515,"5","5.5","penetration testing","easy","scenario","A tester gathers public records, search engine data, and third-party information without touching target systems. Which phase is this?",["Active reconnaissance","Passive reconnaissance","Vulnerability scanning","Threat hunting"],1,"La reconnaissance passive collecte des informations sans interaction directe avec la cible."],
  [516,"5","5.5","penetration testing","easy","scenario","A tester directly probes the target network to discover open ports, services, and access points. What type of reconnaissance is this?",["Threat analysis","Passive reconnaissance","Active reconnaissance","Social engineering"],2,"La reconnaissance active interagit avec les systemes cibles et peut etre detectee."],
  [517,"5","5.5","penetration testing","easy","scenario","An internal team defends against simulated attacks from an external red team. What type of testing describes the internal team's role?",["Offensive penetration testing","Passive penetration testing","Defensive penetration testing","Black box testing"],2,"Le volet defensif teste la detection, la reponse et la mitigation par l'equipe interne."],
  [518,"5","5.1","security awareness","easy","scenario","An unsolicited caller claiming to be IT asks an assistant to confirm username and password. How should she respond?",["Decline and report to IT","Provide username only","Ask for an email","Hang up silently"],0,"Il faut refuser de divulguer des identifiants et signaler la tentative de vishing."],
  [519,"5","5.5","compliance","easy","scenario","A tech review publishes vulnerabilities in a company's smart home devices. What immediate outcome is most likely?",["Innovation award","Reputational damage and decreased sales","More retailer partnerships","Recruitment surge"],1,"La publication de failles peut reduire la confiance client et nuire aux ventes."],
  [520,"5","5.5","privacy","easy","scenario","A software company expands to Europe and processes EU citizens' personal data. Which legal implication is most critical?",["Register with software associations","GDPR compliance","Software patents in each country","European coding standard"],1,"Le RGPD encadre strictement le traitement des donnees personnelles de citoyens de l'UE."],
  [521,"5","5.5","privacy","easy","scenario","An EU company suffers a breach and fails key GDPR provisions. What is the most likely immediate consequence?",["Forced shutdown","Executive imprisonment","Required public apology","Substantial fines"],3,"Le RGPD prevoit des amendes importantes en cas de non-conformite."],
  [522,"5","5.5","penetration testing","medium","scenario","Internal security and external ethical hackers collaboratively assess vulnerabilities, simulate attacks, and evaluate defenses. What form of testing is this?",["Black box testing","Integrated penetration testing","Defensive penetration testing","Red team assessment"],1,"Le test integre, proche du purple teaming, combine equipes offensives et defensives."],
  [523,"5","5.5","penetration testing","easy","scenario","Testers receive firmware source code, architecture diagrams, and internal details. What kind of test is this?",["Zero-knowledge testing","Open box testing","Opaque testing","Blind testing"],1,"Open box ou white box donne une forte visibilite sur les composants internes."],
  [524,"5","5.5","privacy","medium","scenario","A GDPR data subject asks an online platform to delete all personal data under the Right to be Forgotten. What is the primary obligation?",["Retain but stop marketing","Delete personal data unless legally required to keep it","Anonymize and notify only","Move data to encrypted storage"],1,"Le droit a l'effacement impose la suppression sauf obligation ou justification legale de conservation."],
  [525,"5","5.5","penetration testing","easy","scenario","A hosting company invites ethical hackers to find vulnerabilities without giving details about systems. Which method is this?",["External testing","Grey box testing","Active testing","Black box testing"],3,"Le black box ne fournit pas d'informations internes prealables aux testeurs."],
  [526,"5","5.5","compliance","easy","scenario","An e-commerce platform wants an external review and formal report validating security operations for shareholders. Which assessment fits?",["External examination of IT controls and operations","Internal review","External financial audit","Informal peer feedback"],0,"Un examen externe des controles IT donne une evaluation structuree et independante de la posture securite."],
  [527,"5","5.3","contracts","easy","scenario","A vendor violated data handling clauses and exposed customer data. What contractual impact is most probable?",["Bonuses for early completion","Free additional services only","Contract termination and possible damages","Project timeline extension"],2,"Une violation de clauses de protection des donnees peut mener a rupture de contrat et dommages."],
  [528,"5","5.5","compliance","easy","scenario","A bank wants official attestation that its cybersecurity measures meet industry standards. What should it choose?",["Customer feedback","Internal IT report","External independent third-party audit","Informal consultancy evaluation"],2,"Un audit tiers independant fournit une attestation reconnue de conformite ou d'efficacite."],
  [529,"5","5.5","compliance","easy","scenario","A CISO must report audit findings to internal stakeholders and a government regulator. Which reporting types are correct?",["Internal to regulator, external to stakeholders","External to both","Internal report for stakeholders and external report for regulator","Only external report"],2,"Les rapports internes sont adaptes a l'organisation; les rapports externes sont destines aux regulateurs ou tiers."],
  [530,"5","5.5","penetration testing","easy","scenario","Pen testers receive user credentials, topology diagrams, and some code snippets. Which testing type is this?",["Black box testing","Double-blind testing","Known environment testing","Zero-knowledge testing"],2,"Known environment donne certaines informations internes aux testeurs."],
  [531,"5","5.5","compliance","easy","scenario","A third-party auditor provides a formal statement verifying control effectiveness. What is this statement called?",["Certification","Accreditation","Attestation","Assurance"],2,"Une attestation est une declaration formelle qu'un critere ou controle est satisfait."],
  [532,"5","5.3","supply chain","easy","scenario","A company wants foundational security data from many vendors efficiently. What is most cost-effective?",["Pen test each vendor","Send security questionnaires","Visit every vendor site","Review annual financial reports"],1,"Les questionnaires securite standardisent la collecte d'informations a grande echelle."],
  [533,"5","5.3","contracts","easy","scenario","Two firms form a cloud security partnership and need terms, roles, and shared responsibilities. Which agreement fits?",["NDA","SLA","Business partners agreement (BPA)","MOU"],2,"Un BPA detaille les termes de partenariat, responsabilites et arrangements entre partenaires."],
  [534,"5","5.5","compliance","easy","scenario","A company wants its own IT department to evaluate compliance before external auditors arrive. Which approach should it adopt?",["Third-party vulnerability scan","Internal compliance assessment","External attestation","Vendor risk assessment"],1,"Une evaluation interne de conformite verifie les exigences avant audit externe."],
  [535,"5","5.5","penetration testing","easy","scenario","Before a pen test, a CEO wants critical systems excluded and operations protected. What defines scope and boundaries?",["SLA","NDA","Rules of engagement (ROE)","MOU"],2,"Les ROE definissent perimetre, limites, methodes autorisees et contraintes du test."],
  [536,"5","5.1","security awareness","easy","scenario","A company launches a simulated phishing campaign to assess reporting. What first step best supports campaign success?",["Warn all employees beforehand","Create a realistic phishing email","Reward users who click","Review last year's results"],1,"Un email realiste mesure mieux la capacite des employes a reconnaitre les menaces courantes."],
  [537,"5","5.5","penetration testing","easy","scenario","Pen testers receive technology stack details but not details of security controls. What kind of test is this?",["White box testing","External testing","Grey box testing","Active testing"],2,"Le grey box donne une connaissance partielle de la cible."],
  [538,"5","5.5","privacy","easy","scenario","A company decides purposes and means of data processing while a third party stores the data. How are they classified?",["Company processor; third party controller","Company controller; third party processor","Both processors","Both controllers"],1,"Le controller decide; le processor traite ou stocke pour le compte du controller."],
  [539,"5","5.1","security awareness","easy","scenario","A user receives a bank email with a lookalike website and misspelled URL. What should she do?",["Forward to colleagues","Click and update details","Delete only","Report to IT and avoid links"],3,"Un lien legerement modifie est typique du phishing; il faut signaler et ne pas cliquer."],
  [540,"5","5.5","penetration testing","easy","scenario","A firm hires testers to challenge a web application and exploit vulnerabilities like real attackers. What type of testing is this?",["White box testing","Defensive penetration testing","Offensive penetration testing","Gray box testing"],2,"Le test offensif cherche activement a exploiter les vulnerabilites comme un attaquant."]
